{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"MultipleValueCustomFields\">Multiple Value Custom Fields</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Custom CustomField CustomFields From FromDate Is MultipleValueCustomFields On Options Select To ToDate User Users\"><em>Multiple value custom fields</em> allow users to select multiple options from a predefined list.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"HasWhere On Select\">These fields are perfect for tags, categories, features, or any attribute where multiple selections apply.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"HasWhere Is On Options Select User Users\">Unlike dropdown lists where users can only choose one option, multiple value fields let users select several options simultaneously.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Custom Customer To ToDate Type\">For example, you could use them to track multiple product features, service types, or customer interests.</p><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Name\">Name</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Name\">Name</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Name On\">The name of each multiple value field as it appears on forms throughout the system.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Name On Select To ToDate\">Use plural names when appropriate, such as 'Product Features' or 'Service Categories', to indicate that multiple selections are possible.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Placement\">Placement</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Placement\">Placement</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Is\">Shows which forms include this multiple value field.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Is On Port Rate Reports Select User Users\">When users make selections, the chosen values appear as comma-separated lists on forms and in reports.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And By Filter Group Port Reports Select To ToDate\">You can use these fields for filtering and grouping data in reports, making it easy to analyze records by selected attributes.</p></div></details>",
  "key": "multiple-value-custom-fields"
}
